description	"Rebel Pilot

Agile pilots who rely on their quick-thinking and resilience to survive.

^2Weaponry:
- Melee
- Survival Knife (Cyan/Blue Saber)
-- No Saber/Blaster Block
-- No Saber Training
-- Low Damage, Cripples On Hit
- DL-44 Self Defense Pistol
-- DC Carbine (1)
-- Small Clip, Mag Reload
-- 100%- RoF, 60%+ Damage/FP Drain
- Signal Flare
-- Frag Grenade (1)
-- Large Radius, 99% Less Damage
-- Tracks On Hit

^8Attributes:
- Reinforcements (4)
- Close Combat Training (3)
- Assemble (3)
- Tracking Beacon
- Dexterity (1)
- Knockdown Roll

^8Abilities:
- Dex Roll ^3[CS3]
- Dodge (2) ^3[CS1]
- Quickthrow (1) ^3[CS2]
- Gunkick ^3[CS4]"